* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* NATRPEND  NOM Termination
*
* uid yy-mm-dd Mark   Comment
* --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* gw  91-09-25        RETURN instead of STOP.
* fhi 00-09-05 QA01   Leave NOM with message line bottom
* xsetggr 2012-02-01 NOMALL-1100 write language independant msgs in log
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------
DEFINE DATA GLOBAL USING NRM-GL
LOCAL USING RLOG-L
END-DEFINE
*
************************************************************************
* Main line
************************************************************************
*
LG-USERID := G-USERID
LG-CODE := 'UO'
COMPRESS '0077' G-USERID TO LG-MSG
CALLNAT 'RLOG' PL-PARMS
END TRANSACTION
** STOP NATURAL REPORTS SESSION
**
SET CONTROL 'U'
*ERROR-TA := ' '
SET CONTROL 'MB'
STACK TOP COMMAND 'RETURN'
STOP
*
END
